        "Hyperparameters are tuned using grid search, where each specification is evaluated on the validation set using RMSE, consistent with the MSPE objective in GKX. The Elastic Net grid varies both penalty strength and the balance between $L_1$ and $L_2$ regularization, while the Neural Network grid varies the regularization strength for a fixed architecture.\n",
